    <DocCode language="ts" title="threadProblem — real messages">
{"threadProblem({ diameter: 6, pitch: 4, length: 10, internal: false })\n// \u0022A pitch of 4 mm is too coarse for a 6 mm thread\u0022       (pitch > d/2)\nthreadProblem({ diameter: 6, pitch: 0.1, length: 10, internal: false })\n// \u0022A thread has at most 58 turns (this one is 100.0 long: 10 mm at a pitch of 0.1 mm)\u0022\nthreadProblem({ diameter: 6, pitch: 1, length: 10, internal: false })   // undefined: buildable"}
    </DocCode>
    <p>The 58-turn limit is <code>COIL_MAX_TURNS − 2</code>: the ridge starts one pitch before the thread and ends one after, so the flat end cuts meet the full profile.</p>
