  <section id="troubleshooting" class="doc-section">
    <h2>Troubleshooting</h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Message</th><th>Fix</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>A gear needs a module &gt; 0 and at least 6 whole teeth</td><td>use z ≥ 6 and an integer tooth count</td></tr>
        <tr><td>The pressure angle must be between 0 and 45 degrees</td><td>20° is standard; 14.5° and 25° are common alternatives</td></tr>
        <tr><td>A pitch of P mm is too coarse for a D mm thread</td><td>pitch must be at most half the diameter</td></tr>
        <tr><td>A thread has at most 58 turns</td><td>split the thread into shorter features, or use a coarser pitch</td></tr>
        <tr><td>The sheet thickness must be positive (it is 0)</td><td>pass a thickness &gt; 0</td></tr>
        <tr><td>The path is too tight for this thickness: its offset curve breaks up</td><td>increase the bend radius or reduce the thickness</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

